    "Live CD, not an install: the golden vmstate lives in an otherwise empty 1G qcow2 (ubuntu.qcow2) alongside the read-only ISO — both are the device set",
    "Pointer: usb-tablet abs, but Linux 2.6.8 mousedev rescales the tablet to 1024x768 while X runs at 640x480 — SH_CURSOR_SCALE=0.625 (640/1024) on the daemon's abs path cancels it (same trick as tinycore's 0.783); measured on the golden clone: unscaled (0,0) landed at ~(130,390)",
